WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:05.410
Hi, if you're watching this,

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.970
you probably got one of these letters from me.

3
00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:10.450
I'm Ryan with LRG Homes.

4
00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.400
I know you probably get a lot of these,

5
00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:15.200
and it's hard to figure out if they're real or not.

6
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.543
But there's a real person behind this one.

7
00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:20.003
I'm a real local cash buyer

8
00:00:20.043 --> 00:00:22.227
here in the South Bay Area,

9
00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:25.967
and I've been buying and flipping homes for about 15 years now.

10
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:27.650
Here's how it works.

11
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:32.070
When you call, text, or e-mail, we'll have a discussion about the house.

12
00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:36.470
And I'll be able to give you an all-cash offer within 24 hours.

13
00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:39.610
If the number works for you, I'll come out and see the house.

14
00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:43.367
No repairs, no cleaning, no showings.

15
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.150
You pick the closing date.

16
00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.807
And if it's not a fit, no hard feelings.

17
00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:51.767
So if you got my letter, you can call, text, or email me anytime.

18
00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:54.410
There's also a number that's going to be on the screen.

19
00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:56.190
Hope to hear from you.
